# {{ project_name }}

Package: `src/{{ package_name }}/`. Tests: `tests/`.

## Commands

- `make check` — lint, type check and test (run before finishing a task)
- `make fmt` — auto-fix lint issues and format
- `uv add <pkg>` / `uv add --group <group> <pkg>` — add dependencies (groups: `lint`, `test`, `dev`)

## Conventions

- Ruff (line length 110) for linting and formatting; `ty` for type checking.
- No `print()`; use `logging.getLogger(__name__)`. Only entry points call `setup_logging()` (`log.py`).
- Use relative imports inside the package (`from .settings import ...`).
- Configuration lives in `settings.py` (pydantic-settings): add a field per env var and document it in
  `.env.example`. Access it with `get_settings()`; don't read `os.environ` directly.
